[{:db/id -1, :adr/id "adr-2605260115-mitate-condition-1-allergic-rhinitis-perennial", :adr/title "mitate Wave 1 condition 1 — allergic rhinitis (perennial / IgE-mediated) diagnostic + treatment routing (intake → triage → IgE panel → SLIT cohort)", :adr/status "proposed", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/source-format "edn", :adr/body "\n# Context\n\n通年性アレルギー性鼻炎は 5 条件中 最も高頻度 (日本成人 25-40%)、典型像が確立されており Wave 1 reference の中で diagnostic accuracy が最も高い condition。\n\n主因 antigen は (i) ハウスダスト (Dermatophagoides farinae / pteronyssinus = ダニ抗原)、(ii) ペットダンダー (Fel d 1 / Can f 1)、(iii) カビ (Aspergillus / Alternaria / Cladosporium / Penicillium)。季節性 (花粉) は別 sub-condition と扱う (Wave 2+ で carve-out)。\n\n## 鑑別シグネチャ (clinical reasoning core)\n\n| Sign | Sensitivity | Specificity | Source |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 朝起床直後最悪 | 0.78 | 0.82 | Bousquet ARIA 2008 |\n| くしゃみ 5 回以上連発 | 0.65 | 0.88 | 鼻アレルギー診療ガイドライン 2020 |\n| 水様性鼻汁 (mucoid ではなく) | 0.71 | 0.79 | 同上 |\n| 目のかゆみ併発 | 0.72 | 0.91 (Conjunctivitis 合併) | 同上 |\n| 寝具・カーペット・掃除で増悪 | 0.59 | 0.84 (ダニ抗原暴露) | Custovic 2015 |\n| 家族のアトピー素因 | 0.42 | 0.69 | 同上 |\n| 鼻粘膜蒼白浮腫 (鼻鏡) | 0.62 | 0.86 | 鼻アレルギー診療ガイドライン |\n\nBayesian prior (R1 advisory に組み込み): 上記 7 sign のうち 5 以上陽性で post-test probability ≥ 0.75 → advisory tier で「条件 1 が最も尤度高い」と返す。3-4 陽性 → 条件 1 / 2 鑑別困難 → 鼻汁好酸球検査 (R2 ordering) を recommend。\n\n## yakushi cross-actor 整合\n\n| Treatment tier | yakushi lot dispense | mitate advisory |\n|---|---|---|\n| 第2世代抗ヒスタミン (OTC) | yakushi Wave 1b cetirizine / loratadine | mitate recommends INN, yakushi-side dispense |\n| 第1世代抗ヒスタミン (OTC sedating) | yakushi Wave 1 chlorpheniramine / Wave 1b diphenhydramine | 夜間用 advisory (G11 sedation warning) |\n| 鼻噴霧ステロイド (OTC) | (Wave 2+ candidate — mometasone / fluticasone OTC switched in PMDA/FDA/EMA) | mitate advisory recommends INN, yakushi-side dispense (Wave 2 milestone) |\n| 抗ロイコトリエン薬 (Rx, モンテルカスト) | NOT yakushi (Rx — N2) | mitate `escalation = \"recommend-md-visit\"` to obtain Rx |\n| 舌下免疫療法 SLIT (Rx adherent-self-administered) | NOT yakushi initially; potential Wave 3+ if PMDA OTC-switched | mitate `slit_cohort_tracker` for 3-5 yr longitudinal |\n| 抗 IgE 抗体 (ゾレア, Rx 高額生物製剤) | NOT yakushi (biologics — N3 inheritance) | mitate `escalation = \"recommend-md-specialist-allergy\"` |\n\n# Decision\n\n## Decision 1 — Bayesian triage logic (rhinitis_triage cell, R1)\n\n`rhinitis_triage` cell は 5-condition Bayesian classifier (gemma4:e4b distill medical variant) を以下の order で実行:\n\n1. Top-7 sign 陽性数で condition-1 posterior probability を compute (Naive Bayes baseline + LLM second-pass for narrative cohesion check)\n2. Posterior ≥ 0.75 → advisory tier output \"条件 1 高尤度\";Posterior 0.5-0.75 → \"条件 1 と条件 2 の鑑別が必要、R2 IgE panel + 鼻汁好酸球検査を recommend\";Posterior < 0.5 → 他 4 condition の比較に進む\n3. 全 case で disclaimer (G3) + emergency_screen 結果 (G5) + G6 escalation flag (pediatric / pregnancy / immunocompromised) を出力\n\n## Decision 2 — allergy_ige_panel_order cell (R2)\n\nView39 相当 (39 項目 IgE specific 検査、保険適用 ~5,000 円) を `mitate.diagnosticOrder` lexicon で外部臨床検査ラボに routing。\n\nOrder payload:\n\n```\ndiagnosticOrder {\n  orderType: \"ige-panel-39\",\n  conditionContext: \"allergic-rhinitis-perennial-rule-in\",\n  consentReceiptCid: <CID of patient consent record>,\n  physicianAttestorDid: <licensed MD DID>,    # R2+ required\n  scopedAntigens: [\n    \"Df1\", \"Dp1\",             # ダニ\n    \"Fel-d-1\", \"Can-f-1\",     # ペット\n    \"Asp-f-1\", \"Alt-a-1\",     # カビ\n    \"Cry-j-1\", \"Cry-j-2\",     # スギ (花粉 reference)\n    ...\n  ],\n  resultDeliveryChannel: \"encrypted-mst-envelope\"   # G2 mandatory\n}\n```\n\n検査結果 (`mitate.diagnosticResult`) は XChaCha20-Poly1305 envelope only、sealed-recipient = patient + Council medical advisory DIDs + licensed MD DID。\n\n## Decision 3 — nasal_smear_eosinophil cell (R2)\n\n鼻汁好酸球 > 20% で条件 1 (アレルギー性) 強く支持、< 5% で条件 2 (血管運動性) 支持。Mimi (顕微鏡) class + zebulun ノードで自動 image classification (R2+ で gemma4:e4b vision distill 経路、open weights only)。\n\n## Decision 4 — Treatment ladder advisory (treatment_router cell, R2)\n\nmild → moderate → severe → severe-refractory の 4-tier:\n\n| Severity | Advisory (mitate) | Action (yakushi / external) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Mild (くしゃみ・鼻汁 < 4/day) | 環境調整 (寝具 60℃ 洗濯、HEPA、湿度 40-50%) + 第2世代抗ヒスタミン PRN | yakushi Wave 1b dispense cetirizine / loratadine |\n| Moderate (4-10/day, QOL 影響) | 上記 + 鼻噴霧ステロイド 定期 | yakushi Wave 2 (mometasone / fluticasone OTC) — pending |\n| Severe (>10/day, 睡眠障害) | 上記 + 抗ロイコトリエン薬 (Rx) | `escalation = \"recommend-md-visit\"` |\n| Severe-refractory or 3-5 yr 寛解希望 | SLIT (ダニ / スギ Rx 製剤 ミティキュア / シダキュア) | `escalation = \"recommend-md-allergy-specialist\"` + `slit_cohort_tracker` 開始 |\n\n## Decision 5 — slit_cohort_tracker cell (R3)\n\nSLIT 開始 patient の 3-5 year longitudinal QOL + adherence + adverse event tracking。月次 QOL questionnaire (JRQLQ) + 毎日 adherence pingback (adherent-driven, push notification G11 carve-out only for SLIT 適応 patient with explicit opt-in)。\n\nyakushi `pharma_post_market_surveillance` に aggregated cohort outcome feed (G7 + G10 enforcement)。\n\n## Decision 6 — silen-mitate-review triggers (condition 1)\n\n| Trigger | Required | Council |\n|---|---|---|\n| condition-1-bayesian-prior-baseline | Yes (R1 deploy) | Lv6+ ≥ 3 |\n| condition-1-triage-llm-prompt-template-baseline | Yes (R1 deploy) | Lv6+ ≥ 3 + 1 licensed MD |\n| condition-1-ige-panel-antigen-list-baseline | Yes (R2 deploy) | Lv6+ ≥ 3 + 1 licensed MD |\n| condition-1-treatment-ladder-baseline | Yes (R2 deploy) | Lv6+ ≥ 3 + 2 licensed MD |\n| slit-cohort-protocol-baseline | Yes (R3 deploy) | Lv6+ ≥ 3 + 2 licensed MD + 1 allergist |\n| condition-1-bias-audit-quarterly | Yes (R2+ ongoing) | Lv6+ ≥ 3 |\n\n# Consequences\n\n**Positive**:\n\n- 最高頻度 + 最高 diagnostic accuracy condition で Wave 1 advisory tier の clinical value を最大化\n- yakushi Wave 1 chlorpheniramine + Wave 1b cetirizine / loratadine / diphenhydramine の自然な指名;mitate↔yakushi feedback loop の最初の正規 case\n- SLIT cohort tracker が religious-corp 内 longitudinal adherence data の初の 3-5 yr scale construct ― ADR-2605231500 kotoba-datomic-projection の hot-path read carve-out の正面 case\n\n**Negative / costs**:\n\n- IgE panel ordering (R2) は外部臨床検査ラボ routing 必要 ― 個人情報保護法 要配慮個人情報 移管の consent receipt 設計が複雑\n- 鼻噴霧ステロイド (mometasone / fluticasone) は yakushi Wave 2+ ― mitate R2 deploy 時点で OTC dispense routing が未完成\n- SLIT は Rx ― mitate は処方発行できず `escalation = \"recommend-md-visit\"` 経由でしか開始できない (R3 cohort tracker 開始 trigger が patient-supplied SLIT 製剤 lot ID + licensed MD attestation 経由)\n\n**Risks**:\n\n- IgE panel false positive 率 (~10-15% in non-symptomatic population) が community-level の over-treatment を誘発しうる ― G10 bias audit に「IgE-positive but asymptomatic over-treatment rate」metric を追加必要\n- SLIT 3-5 yr adherence は < 60% 一般 ― cohort tracker の attrition handling + G11 (no addictive engagement) 整合の adherent-driven reminder 設計が R3 critical path\n\n# Alternatives Considered\n\n## A. 季節性花粉症も condition 1 に包含\n\nRejected. 通年性 (ダニ / ペット / カビ) と季節性 (花粉) は temporal pattern + 治療 timing (季節前 step-up) + cohort tracker の cadence が異なる ― 季節性は Wave 2+ で carve out。\n\n## B. View39 ではなく単項目 IgE のみ order\n\nRejected. 通年性 antigen の鑑別には minimum 6 項目 (Df1 / Dp1 / Fel-d-1 / Can-f-1 / Asp-f-1 / Alt-a-1) 必要;単項目 order の cost-efficiency が悪い + 患者多重 visit cost が高い。\n\n# References\n\n- ADR-2605260100 (mitate master charter)\n- ADR-2605250500 (yakushi master) + ADR-2605250600 (Wave 1b 抗ヒスタミン dispense)\n- 鼻アレルギー診療ガイドライン (日本耳鼻咽喉科免疫アレルギー学会) 2020\n- Bousquet J et al. ARIA 2008 — Allergic Rhinitis and its Impact on Asthma\n- Custovic A 2015 — House dust mite allergy\n", :adr/path "90-docs/adr/2605260115-mitate-condition-1-allergic-rhinitis-perennial.edn", :adr/source-repo "root", :adr/topic "mitate-allergic-rhinitis-perennial", :adr/last_verified "2026-05-25", :adr/date "2026-05-25", :adr/authoritative true, :adr/related ["40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/mitate_rhinitis_intake/" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/mitate_rhinitis_triage/" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/mitate_allergy_ige_panel_order/" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/mitate_nasal_smear_eosinophil/" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/mitate_slit_cohort_tracker/"], :adr/authoritative_for ["condition 1 differential signature (morning-worst / sneezing burst / water-clear rhinorrhea / ocular pruritus / dust-bedding trigger)" "View39-equivalent IgE panel routing logic" "鼻汁好酸球検査 (nasal smear) → 条件 1 vs 条件 2 鑑別" "第2世代抗ヒスタミン + 鼻噴霧ステロイド + SLIT 3-tier treatment ladder" "SLIT 3-5 year longitudinal cohort tracker design" "yakushi Wave 1c cetirizine / loratadine / Wave 1c chlorpheniramine 経路との接続"]}]
